      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes, that finger bending is really annoying when we try to communicate in sign language. Some people thought it was a controller issue and bought new ones, but the finger still bends. In other games, such as BoneLab and Alyx, we checked, and the fingers are straight and work perfectly.\n\nTo check the controller settings, go to SteamVR -> Settings -> Controller -> Test Controller.\n\nEven when we let the index finger straighten up, VRChat still shows the index finger bending.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
