      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue happens to me all the time. I have to keep drumming the controllers like almost every 5 minutes. I tested my controllers in Aperture Hand Lab and SteamVR's Test Controller feature. Both controllers looked fine. This issue does harm people's communication and cause us to misunderstand others. Hppedeaf mentioned 3 or 4 years. It is really long. This is a long term issue and the VRChat team have to resolve this issue as soon as possible.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
